autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/f44032c0b488575a105c5802eb55cba3.poster.avif?t=1786091177\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/f44032c0b488575a105c5802eb55cba3.webm?t=1786091177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/f44032c0b488575a105c5802eb55cba3.mp4?t=1786091177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use every advantage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout ahead with surveillance cams, cut the lights to disorient suspects, slip through blind spots, or breach from unexpected angles. The environment is your toolkit, but also your trap. One wrong move, and you're just another headline on the evening news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/b883cf260e48bb9a4f7143d1d0299468.poster.avif?t=1786091177\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/b883cf260e48bb9a4f7143d1d0299468.webm?t=1786091177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620530/extras/b883cf260e48bb9a4f7143d1d0299468.mp4?t=1786091177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Serve the law. Protect the innocent. Command the grittiest precinct in town in Police Stories 2 - a brutal tactical top-down shooter where arrest is the goal, force is the last resort, and every decision has an outcome.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languag